    "updated_at": "2017-05-12T12:48:10Z",
    "body": "Sorry it's taking a while to prepare the corresponding Fullscreen PR, I just keep running into smaller changes that would be nice to do first. The top commit in https://github.com/whatwg/fullscreen/pull/86 should give some idea about where this is going, even though it's in a rough shape.\r\n\r\nLooks like that was automatically published at https://fullscreen.spec.whatwg.org/branch-snapshots/animation-frame-tasks/, so PTAL and see if that changes anything about this PR.",
